Short-term strategy for Crypto 2026

♦️Never enter on impulse - FOMO;
♦️Wait for a correction (small drop) to buy;
♦️Define Take profit (selling for profit) and Stop Loss (strategic exit)
♦️Have patience and perseverance;
♦️Do your own research before following any advice;
♦️Check the chart, RSI, and volume before making a purchase.
♦️Give opportunities to cryptocurrencies with lower profit margins to avoid losses;
Think that little by little the hen fills its belly.
#SolanaUSTD #ETH #bitcoin

